      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dang it! They got me again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006E006700200069007400210020005400680065007900200067006F00740020006D006500200061006700610069006E002100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Someone, get me out of here! Please!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust have your Pokémon hit this thing with a\npowerful move—no need to be gentle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Someone’s all wrapped up in Pokémon webbing.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHit it with a high-powered Pokémon move to\nbreak it open and save whoever’s inside!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve gotta use a stronger move than that!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTo check a move’s power, just open the menu,\npick a Pokémon, and choose “Change moves.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500068006500770021001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for your help getting me out of that sticky\nsituation! You really saved me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How did that happen?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000640069006400200074006800610074002000680061007000700065006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Who did that to you?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006F00200064006900640020007400680061007400200074006F00200079006F0075003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was the work of these Spinarak here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020007700610073002000740068006500200077006F0072006B0020006F00660020007400680065007300650020005300700069006E006100720061006B00200068006500720065002E001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, truth is, the three of them are my partners—\nI call ’em the Spinarak Sibbies!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When they get angry, they always wrap me up\nand leave me high and dry like that...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Spin spin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300700069006E0020007300700069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This time, I messed up by destroying a web they’d\njust finished making. BIG mistake!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The three of ’em strung me up and left me\nhanging, but I wish they’d shown some mercy...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIt’s not like I did it on purpose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SPIN SPIN!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300500049004E0020005300500049004E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, OK! You’ve made your point! I’ll be more\ncareful, I promise!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002C0020004F004B002100200059006F00752019007600650020006D00610064006500200079006F0075007200200070006F0069006E00740021002000492019006C006C0020006200650020006D006F00720065000A006300610072006500660075006C002C00200049002000700072006F006D0069007300650021001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you know what’d be a better use for all that\nsilk? Nets and ropes to sell for some quick cash!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m kidding! That was a joke! Don’t string me up\nagain, Spinarak Sibbieees!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
